creatures:
- name: Phase Spider
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 14  
      **Hit Points** 45 (rollable(dice=7d10 + 7,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Climb 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 10  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 3 (700 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Ethereal Sight.*** The spider can see 60 feet into the Ethereal Plane while on the Material Plane and vice versa.

      ***Spider Climb.*** The spider can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.

      ***Web Walker.*** The spider ignores movement restrictions caused by webs, and the spider knows the location of any other creature in contact with the same web.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The spider makes two Bite attacks.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d10+3,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=2d8,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Poison damage. If this damage reduces the target to 0 ***Hit Points***, the target becomes ***Stable***, and it has the ***Poisoned*** condition for 1 hour. While ***Poisoned***, the target also has the ***Paralyzed*** condition.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Ethereal Jaunt.*** The spider teleports from the Material Plane to the Ethereal Plane or vice versa.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
